 another room to another mystery, another puzzle, and a challenge. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126130/extras/a4bc8f6048069757955ce7118bd3481b.poster.avif?t=1682927549\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126130/extras/a4bc8f6048069757955ce7118bd3481b.webm?t=1682927549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126130/extras/a4bc8f6048069757955ce7118bd3481b.mp4?t=1682927549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCAPE</h2>Your only hope is to find your way from the everchanging maze of puzzles and escape the mythical cage. Can you solve them all and.... wake up?<br><br>Dozens of challenging puzzles await you to solve them!", "about_the_game": "<br>The Pillar is fully playable on Steam Deck<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to The Pillar! Mystery puzzle game on even more mysterious Island.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126130/extras/61bd10229dd3e2bee0aca27b0ad985b6.poster.avif?t=1682927549\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126130/extras/61bd10229dd3e2bee0aca27b0ad985b6.webm?t=1682927549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126130/extras/61bd10229dd3e2bee0aca27b0ad985b6.mp4?t=1682927549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYSTERY</h2>Cleverly mixing mystery and puzzle-solving, the Pillar takes you deep into an unknown world where you explore and relish your surroundings. Each Island has its own unique feel and secrets and it's up to you to solve them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"